{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《2026香港小姐競選》上星期（6月2日）已展開了第一輪面試，當日84位參選佳麗於無綫電視城首晤傳媒，質素燕瘦環肥，風格亦各有不同。今日就是第二輪面試，以下讓大家高清一文睇晒今日到TVB電視城進行第二輪面試的佳麗質素。</p><p>攝：葉志明、陳順禎、陳釗、林迅景</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141349841004138496284179.jpeg/5X4DJg6BenloYdHTozznWoQfFYkqdRBk0ddb_evXW_0\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141349851679166464537612.jpeg/kOTqZlfXcfIbVFC15ljHiXjdE7Ly_WJwSbrdnHO63Zw\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141349849418305536694328.jpeg/6VXI-v8AQh8unwgjH9Ou3fa6KZX-XR2oHEHJDiZByQ4\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141349847002255360653874.jpeg/xUT9YhbsjR5qtx16F2zM02EDDBJyhMJ007eW4-m3luM\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141349844615565312549231.jpeg/zHRBQvBRTe2BTMUZGoneYnQJzk_boLZUBhTDTjwUw04\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141350121221394432179520.jpeg/-rdpXv5BiFKNh8QuXZCzRGBa9-fTzPQiBNIkyz7SJMs\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141349842409230336186234.jpeg/TpdvnLymySEysTny1LrpvFyi7LUJ6iB4-H5hdsJ-YXY\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141349851746275328860974.jpeg/rGlAbehIzIKNCWNXGQZOVZiOtVzMudarwilqevgpano\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141349849313447936109678.jpeg/o0XDonngBzlw_lf2zsDHFBhKsnXodbjAHFoEWyZaBFs\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141349847157444608194368.jpeg/3FdXseZJklGQurP3CLW1MALY6WI8X1sQnL75-qa--fo\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141349844863029248124570.jpeg/vXr1Frv1P23OZjWIwPWaIkCexREqZ2RNMlFyAghRcgI\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141349842287595520708125.jpeg/E77WUgOyqhoiwaUhOL16tTLMhzth2-I_ZPsJql77Cao\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141350514894966784924085.jpeg/IrccO7_6lCTpTxq9XXJGM_jg3NpIGpZA5H0yft59Mn4\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com